    <node id="Water Sensitive Urban Design">
      <data key="d0">Water Sensitive Urban Design</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Water Sensitive Urban Design refers to planning and design strategies aimed at managing water resources sustainably in urban environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Water Sensitive Urban Design refers to strategies aimed at reducing potable water use and improving stormwater quality in new developments.&lt;SEP&gt;Water Sensitive Urban Design refers to strategies aimed at managing urban water resources sustainably, including stormwater management and water conservation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4b9ce25e01842e9a9f20621c5af7a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d99269df833944ee777354505ed70b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1736af71e84567c5018e9590c65c4fa9</data>
