    <node id="Stormwater Management">
      <data key="d0">Stormwater Management</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Stormwater Management involves strategies and practices to control and manage stormwater runoff to protect the urban environment and prevent flooding.&lt;SEP&gt;Stormwater Management involves strategies to manage rainwater runoff to prevent flooding and pollution, as outlined in the document.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61ab9e05affbc2a87b0bca7b9942587b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1736af71e84567c5018e9590c65c4fa9</data>
