    <node id="Marrickville DCP 2011">
      <data key="d0">Marrickville DCP 2011</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Marrickville DCP 2011 is a comprehensive Development Control Plan that establishes guidelines for development within the Marrickville precinct. This document provides a detailed framework for urban planning and development, addressing a wide range of regulations and guidelines that encompass various types of development, including residential projects such as boarding houses, multi-dwelling housing, and residential flat buildings. 

Key aspects of the plan include zoning, building heights, setbacks, and environmental protection, all aimed at ensuring that new developments adhere to sustainable practices and community safety standards. In addition to residential guidelines, Marrickville DCP 2011 incorporates provisions for commercial and mixed-use developments, detailing requirements related to zoning, parking, and heritage considerations. 

The plan emphasizes community safety and environmental sustainability, integrating regulations for signage, biodiversity, and the preservation of unique environmental features. It also outlines stormwater management regulations and requirements for development activities, ensuring that all developments contribute positively to the local environment and community well-being. 

Furthermore, the document addresses specific facility types, such as child care centres, and includes considerations for various precincts within Marrickville, focusing on zoning, heritage, and urban development. It prioritizes higher density development while considering its impact on residential amenity, heritage conservation, and urban design. The plan also outlines parking policies and guidelines that promote sustainable transport and urban planning.

Marrickville DCP 2011 includes specific guidelines for industrial development, reflecting amendments from IWLEP 2022, and provides detailed regulations for subdivision, amalgamation, and environmental protection. It addresses critical aspects of residential developments, such as acoustic and visual privacy, solar access, and overshadowing, ensuring that developments respect the privacy and amenity of existing residents.

Overall, Marrickville DCP 2011 serves as a crucial guide for managing development in the region, promoting a balanced approach to urban growth while safeguarding the community and its environment. The document is fundamentally focused on heritage conservation, zoning, public amenities, and environmental protection, making it an essential resource for urban planning in Marrickville.&lt;SEP&gt;Marrickville DCP 2011 is a development control plan that provides guidelines for development applications in the Marrickville area.&lt;SEP&gt;Marrickville DCP 2011 is a document outlining various planning and development guidelines for the Marrickville area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e1fbe8129fe742aaa24cc55e916f313b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f378bfc7affe684c3aac11f49de9ad26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9f8b9264ff0957fdda225adc03ecd8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fb736589f71248962f8628c6d3692fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cf7ce8c5c0949b1b86a8e47f7228f94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04fc82bd9f8d6b8275d065997aa8f868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4b9ce25e01842e9a9f20621c5af7a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31809602d836093c238bc03107a2818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7f49db9ee30dac0049a5dea96a1d13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9d61ff33d99f29c64280cda352a7e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab0b03a2047d45cabed3fa2f9316ed55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede3f0c32828f4b0e3b02c54f183248d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87430f5e59a6ebf83ad2effb0d0c7c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1f49e5aadd29b5bcadcba77a54fff18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94ca42d916d2dc441640ea4f654937fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e3b8918ad7af14fee5372f0b5d17fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79082b6bb2d76c88d6e762c576391923&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6584ae852c3ea64ea2e6d3fce4e260c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61ab9e05affbc2a87b0bca7b9942587b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a291d3597433f2f4ca0cac663df58efa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1736af71e84567c5018e9590c65c4fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55e7f816aeb5bc0b04e395d2bb8da2ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29165f1ad51788dd6652f1ebd68a4cdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c0e3fea4c49ea1b02b54f34ca9ad90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fc6ffe0c1dd4b4287d57f7cb7cdf731&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8bf2dbd0fddd2095cdd177b762906b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c08da1106007d82a12602d7e6ca8ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a721bffdc6fa81fbc95a4700230d035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c90d09fd86358ff34cca423643290bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa8775a9fb88eae75c0cecab2248a9b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a272db34d4679f9e98df4bae0b64e8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f28867a3fc10524b43c49ac8a114c352&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79f2590e4864033adcd75d80c8f0f75b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24abc80a7b906aa0b5d6df776024f2d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-991497c660dc3fe8326554255605fb5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2212976ca0dabb113f19b67f0c7285d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0d28d9dfe3d854d55cc3f004065bf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9453500f14b669b018e643ef12d3011d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5463c951d38c2290291978c870a08c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edecfcccf27421c8ba2e93ecb1bc28f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecafc12c5a9c1