    <node id="Cooks River">
      <data key="d0">Cooks River</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Cooks River is a geographical feature adjacent to the Marrickville area, significant for its open space and public access.&lt;SEP&gt;Cooks River is a geographical feature mentioned in relation to stormwater discharge regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Cooks River is a waterway that the Eastern Channel 1 North and East sub catchments drain into, indicating its significance in the local environmental context.</data>
