    <node id="On-site Stormwater Detention (OSD)">
      <data key="d0">On-site Stormwater Detention (OSD)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">On-site Stormwater Detention (OSD) refers to a stormwater management practice that limits discharges from developments to pre-development conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;On-site Stormwater Detention (OSD) refers to systems designed to limit stormwater discharges from developments to pre-development conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79082b6bb2d76c88d6e762c576391923&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6c6ca49f660a22bbe6152886d5c1dbd</data>
