    <node id="On Site Retention (OSR)">
      <data key="d0">On Site Retention (OSR)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">On Site Retention (OSR) is a method used to manage stormwater by retaining it on-site, applicable for certain types of developments.&lt;SEP&gt;On Site Retention (OSR) is a stormwater management practice that involves retaining stormwater on-site for reuse, such as for toilet cisterns and irrigation systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79082b6bb2d76c88d6e762c576391923&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6c6ca49f660a22bbe6152886d5c1dbd</data>
