      <data key="d0">Clause 2.5</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clause 2.5 emphasizes equity of access and mobility in urban planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause 2.5 pertains to equity of access and mobility, emphasizing the need for adequate parking facilities and accessibility features in development applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-489fcda892097faf351f3c6138355afb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e31559520dd19b21fb017451dd55e77f</data>
