      <data key="d0">Clause 2.7</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clause 2.7 addresses solar access and overshadowing concerns in development.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause 2.7 focuses on solar access and overshadowing, detailing requirements for sunlight access to residential areas and the placement of solar panels.</data>
