    <node id="CPTED Principles">
      <data key="d0">CPTED Principles</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">CPTED (Crime Prevention Through Environmental Design) principles are strategies aimed at reducing crime through urban design and environmental planning.&lt;SEP&gt;CPTED Principles refer to Crime Prevention Through Environmental Design principles aimed at enhancing safety in community spaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03161479daf844c731d972f919f75113&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fc6ffe0c1dd4b4287d57f7cb7cdf731</data>
