    <node id="IWLEP 2022">
      <data key="d0">IWLEP 2022</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">IWLEP 2022 refers to the Inner West Local Environmental Plan 2022, which includes amendments relevant to development applications and land use in the Leichhardt area.&lt;SEP&gt;IWLEP 2022 refers to the Inner West Local Environmental Plan 2022, which includes amendments relevant to planning and development in the Inner West area.&lt;SEP&gt;IWLEP 2022, or the Inner West Local Environmental Plan 2022, serves as a comprehensive regulatory framework for land use and development within the Inner West area, specifically including the Leichhardt region. This plan encompasses various amendments that are pertinent to development, outlining zoning and development provisions that guide urban planning in the area. 

IWLEP 2022 addresses multiple aspects of development control, such as the provisions for child care centres in Marrickville, as well as guidelines for subdivision and amalgamation. It also incorporates development controls that are detailed in the Marrickville Development Control Plan (DCP), ensuring that development aligns with the needs of the local community and considers environmental factors. Additionally, the plan includes amendments that are integrated into the Leichhardt DCP, further emphasizing its role in shaping land use and development in the Inner West.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c559c94a28d4e3274c2163f18c72dae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f832ae0e708eef5d6da39079c74ab40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c352a86c25d60c8d71c84ba99639bbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31ca0ad7ef033136702ccbb86559a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2efc94b48e1b56115f1aef22e3244ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0d28d9dfe3d854d55cc3f004065bf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed559eb921e82179a5ab2b83d8456566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87f3217d092603d5e1a949d5ef9939fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a508bfc5d79a3f8e112147c41e0822e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-559fa0a250051042f9354b0984303a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6584ae852c3ea64ea2e6d3fce4e260c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a272db34d4679f9e98df4bae0b64e8b</data>
