      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Parramatta Road is a significant roadway located within the Marrickville area, recognized for its importance in the context of development and parking regulations. It serves as a major thoroughfare that is closely associated with zoning, parking, and heritage items within the precinct. Specifically, Parramatta Road is designated as Commercial Precinct 35 under the Marrickville Development Control Plan (DCP) 2011, highlighting its role as a commercial precinct within the local zoning regulations.</data>
