      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Marrickville Metro is a shopping center situated in Marrickville, recognized as Precinct 39 in the Marrickville Development Control Plan (DCP) 2011, which emphasizes commercial zoning. The shopping center is currently undergoing redevelopment, which incorporates historical elements, including the Mill House, while also addressing parking and access issues. This redevelopment aims to resolve conflicts with the surrounding residential areas and enhance local amenity, all while adhering to development controls and heritage considerations.</data>
