      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The GreenWay Corridor is an active transport corridor designed to offer environmental benefits while promoting public art and street activation. It is recognized in the Marrickville Development Control Plan (DCP) 2011 for its visual and environmental advantages. Additionally, the GreenWay Corridor serves as an ecological corridor that seeks to enhance biodiversity and connect natural habitats within the precinct. It functions as an important environmental feature aimed at improving local fauna by providing permeability and a buffer of native vegetation.</data>
