      <data key="d0">Haberfield Heritage Conservation Area</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Haberfield Heritage Conservation Area is a designated area in Australia known for its historical and architectural significance as the first Garden Suburb.&lt;SEP&gt;Haberfield Heritage Conservation Area is a designated area with heritage significance, requiring specific controls to maintain its character.&lt;SEP&gt;The Haberfield Heritage Conservation Area is a designated area within the Inner West that has specific development controls to preserve its historical significance.</data>
