    <node id="Inner West Local Environmental Plan 2022">
      <data key="d0">Inner West Local Environmental Plan 2022</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Inner West Local Environmental Plan 2022 is a comprehensive legislative framework that governs land use and development in the Inner West region of New South Wales. This planning document establishes development regulations and requirements, detailing development controls, zoning provisions, and environmental protections. It places a strong emphasis on heritage conservation and the importance of ecological sustainability, ensuring that any development aligns with the area's heritage values. By providing clear guidelines for land use and development, the Inner West Local Environmental Plan 2022 plays a crucial role in shaping the future of the Inner West, guiding responsible development and land use practices within the region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c90d09fd86358ff34cca423643290bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7f49db9ee30dac0049a5dea96a1d13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7320711159fac7b8b992e31aa693fc92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b3e7253c92605b170ab298351d159ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b3711c2cb3fb1c05902ad41af3e1fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fc6ffe0c1dd4b4287d57f7cb7cdf731&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0c3a639f3651511b1cf336e12c2a20b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c99dae31e7eb99f118ca741ce679f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a4deabd0003c3365d9282ec6ef151d6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756462538</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Inner West Local Government Area">
      <data key="d0">Inner West Local Government Area</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Inner West Local Government Area is a designated region in New South Wales, Australia, encompassing several suburbs, including Haberfield. This area is governed by specific planning and zoning regulations, which are detailed in the Leichhardt Development Control Plan (DCP). The Inner West Local Government Area is subject to particular development guidelines and planning controls that aim to manage growth and development within the region effectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c90d09fd86358ff34cca423643290bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163a135d41d128b828c33d3c1699bde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c352a86c25d60c8d71c84ba99639bbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3cee99042961089995b14fb3bff5ef4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756461219</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Environmental Planning &amp; Assessment Act 1979">
      <data key="d0">Environmental Planning &amp; Assessment Act 1979</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Environmental Planning &amp; Assessment Act 1979 is legislation that governs land use and development applications in New South Wales, Australia.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-163a135d41d128b828c33d3c1699bde4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756460764</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Inner West LEP 2022">
      <data key="d0">Inner West LEP 2022</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Inner West LEP 2022 is a local planning policy that guides development in the Inner West area, focusing on urban character and zoning.&lt;SEP&gt;The Inner West LEP 2022 is a planning document that identifies Heritage Conservation Areas and Heritage Items in the Inner West region.&lt;SEP&gt;The Inner West LEP 2022 is a statutory local environmental plan that governs land use and development within the Inner West Local Government Area, particularly focusing on the Leichhardt area. This comprehensive planning instrument establishes land use zones and development standards, providing a framework for zoning, land use, and development controls. It outlines provisions for various activities, including industrial uses, and includes specific regulations and guidelines for heritage conservation to preserve the area's historical and cultural significance. Additionally, the Inner West LEP 2022 permits the establishment of child care centres in various residential and commercial zones, subject to consent. Overall, it aims to manage growth effectively while maintaining the character of the Inner West region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c559c94a28d4e3274c2163f18c72dae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e58bf8dbb5246c231cdb11e6a2798a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-831143d763c0228d83f6339b0baaad8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163a135d41d128b828c33d3c1699bde4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2527bf5981f65b05792478ddefbee3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3bc953210a5686641f76cbe038c74ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d18c8a03e8ddc5412376fe3469c2a28c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa4cb939266bae78512fd7c339d5c7e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-582fa0b062972c42620f6cc6ea46eb56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63b4b9dd8db1aaf82eb3cff13413e1e3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756462409</data>
    </node>
