    <node id="Inner West Council">
      <data key="d0">Inner West Council</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Inner West Council is the governing body that supports the development of town centres and promotes safe, walkable neighbourhoods in the municipality.&lt;SEP&gt;The Inner West Council is the governing body responsible for approving development applications and ensuring compliance with local planning policies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Inner West Council is responsible for the planning and development controls within the precincts mentioned, including heritage and environmental protections.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-83b2b5d842bc44a3db72f68b081bcd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31ca0ad7ef033136702ccbb86559a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3cee99042961089995b14fb3bff5ef4</data>
