    </node>
    <node id="HCA">
      <data key="d0">HCA</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">HCA refers to Heritage Conservation Areas, which are designated areas covered by the DCP for heritage management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00060f44e7476ee6d1aa588656bd98c6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756460767</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ICOMOS Burra Charter 2013">
      <data key="d0">ICOMOS Burra Charter 2013</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The ICOMOS Burra Charter 2013 is a set of guidelines that defines terms related to heritage conservation, used in the context of the DCP.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00060f44e7476ee6d1aa588656bd98c6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756460767</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Heritage Conservation">
      <data key="d0">Heritage Conservation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Heritage Conservation refers to the efforts to conserve and rehabilitate areas with high biodiversity, heritage, or cultural value.&lt;SEP&gt;Heritage conservation refers to the processes involved in preserving and maintaining places of cultural significance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e213365f9a7f0281bb90f965bf8564a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c54e585ffe9dec258b3fafa2a969d4cf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756462618</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Contributory Building 1">
      <data key="d0">Contributory Building 1</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Contributory Building 1 refers to buildings that reflect a key period of significance for the Heritage Conservation Area (HCA) and are important to its character.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e213365f9a7f0281bb90f965bf8564a4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756460906</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Contributory Building 2">
      <data key="d0">Contributory Building 2</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Contributory Building 2 refers to buildings that have been altered but still retain identification from a key period of significance for the HCA.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e213365f9a7f0281bb90f965bf8564a4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756460906</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Neutral Building">
      <data key="d0">Neutral Building</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Neutral Buildings are those that do not detract from the character of the HCA, despite being heavily altered or from a different construction period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e213365f9a7f0281bb90f965bf8564a4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756460906</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Detracting Building">
      <data key="d0">Detracting Building</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Detracting Buildings are those that do not align with the key characteristics of the HCA and are from a construction period outside the key period of significance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e213365f9a7f0281bb90f965bf8564a4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756460906</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Building Style">
      <data key="d0">Building Style</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Building Style refers to the principal historic architectural character of a property within the HCA.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e213365f9a7f0281bb90f965bf8564a4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756460906</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Leichhardt DCP 2013">
      <data key="d0">Leichhardt DCP 2013</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Leichhardt DCP 2013 is a comprehensive Development Control Plan that establishes regulations and guidelines for urban development within the Leichhardt area. This plan addresses critical aspects of urban planning, including building heights, heritage conservation, land use zoning, and residential development. It emphasizes the importance of environmental protection, water management, flood management, and food production, while also promoting community initiatives such as the establishment of community gardens.

The document outlines specific clauses related to building typologies, height limits, setbacks, parking requirements, and land use regulations, ensuring that development aligns with community needs and sustainable practices. Additionally, it incorporates amendments from the IWLEP 2022, enhancing its relevance and applicability to current urban planning challenges. 

Furthermore, Leichhardt DCP 2013 includes guidelines related to contamination and site investigations, reinforcing its role in managing environmental concerns. Overall, Leichhardt DCP 2013 serves as a vital resource for guiding urban development and planning in the region, providing a structured approach to managing growth and preserving the unique character of the Leichhardt area.&lt;SEP&gt;Leichhardt DCP 2013 is a document outlining development control plans and regulations for the Leichhardt area, including various clauses related to land use and heritage conservation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b9d22aea45159c5fff5756eea44f83d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e286e6413a0bfd476b033cc7b5ccfb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-081fadc973ceb31c3d61aefc19c626f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d18c8a03e8ddc5412376fe3469c2a28c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa4cb939266bae78512fd7c339d5c7e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d9aab723725c29550d3d5992e38e1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22bb41e5d9af8e1f44c220ea3ef55754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad9c04cafa3ad3689e9dfa10289aa71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c559c94a28d4e3274c2163f18c72dae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72f295e95bd32e9a02119f496cba255c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed559eb921e82179a5ab2b83d8456566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87f3217d092603d5e1a949d5ef9939fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56038c9ee33eb1b0d6b0916565a9fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b9b1e12f686047b31dc8c9ff5a2e0f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-559fa0a250051042f9354b0984303a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af2f0d6ddbb1555c8a40b5236b475972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1f8f1903ab76680b7ec87649559786&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f832ae0e708eef5d6da39079c74ab40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a31ca0ad7ef033136702ccbb86559a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e213365f9a7f0281bb90f965bf8564a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2baf67d66b01fda7f4e88a70305a53d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e147d34c27345c48d9a24825ca9ae9dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779ec25fbe5c026daa88c5a43c5f66e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a508bfc5d79a3f8e112147c41e0822e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
