      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clause O1 provides details regarding residential development provisions in the Inner West LEP 2022.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause O1 specifies height limits and built form responses for developments in the Leichhardt area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c559c94a28d4e3274c2163f18c72dae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e286e6413a0bfd476b033cc7b5ccfb77</data>
