    <node id="IWLEP 2022 amendments">
      <data key="d0">IWLEP 2022 amendments</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The IWLEP 2022 amendments encompass a series of updates made to the Inner West Local Environmental Plan, which significantly impact development regulations, biodiversity considerations, and planning controls within the Inner West area. These amendments include revisions to the Leichhardt Development Control Plan (DCP) in 2022, introducing changes to various clauses that govern development practices. Additionally, the amendments provide a set of guidelines concerning heritage and building typologies, ensuring that new developments align with the area's historical context and architectural character. Furthermore, the IWLEP 2022 amendments address integrated water and land use planning, establishing an environmental policy framework that guides development applications, thereby influencing both residential and commercial building regulations in the region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38bcadbb83a21dca84588728293ec076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5463c951d38c2290291978c870a08c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22bb41e5d9af8e1f44c220ea3ef55754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56038c9ee33eb1b0d6b0916565a9fa1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede3f0c32828f4b0e3b02c54f183248d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756462293</data>
    </node>
