    <node id="Clause C2">
      <data key="d0">Clause C2</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clause C2 outlines guidelines for additions to existing buildings to maintain compatibility with architectural character.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause C2 provides guidelines for building height transitions when adjacent to taller buildings.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause C2 requires that the site and context analysis demonstrate an understanding of the site and its context, including opportunities and constraints.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c559c94a28d4e3274c2163f18c72dae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcafac0958c581e47c81e3b4834154f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56038c9ee33eb1b0d6b0916565a9fa1a</data>
