    <node id="Clause C3">
      <data key="d0">Clause C3</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clause C3 defines the Building Location Zone (BLZ) for reasonable building placement on the site.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause C3 outlines setback requirements in specific zoning areas to reflect existing character.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause C3 stipulates that the site and context analysis must show how the development will integrate with the streetscape considering scale, proportion, and massing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c559c94a28d4e3274c2163f18c72dae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcafac0958c581e47c81e3b4834154f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56038c9ee33eb1b0d6b0916565a9fa1a</data>
