    <node id="Clause C5">
      <data key="d0">Clause C5</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clause C5 addresses the retention of existing fences that are consistent with the period style of buildings in Marrickville.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause C5 specifies conditions for zero setbacks and acceptable setbacks in relation to neighboring properties and street character.</data>
