      <data key="d0">Clause C6</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Clause C6 discusses setbacks for additional storeys to minimize visibility from the street.&lt;SEP&gt;Clause C6 specifies that new fences must align with traditional designs used in the area, emphasizing simpler detailing.</data>
