      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A heritage conservation area is a designated area recognized for its cultural heritage significance, subject to specific planning controls.&lt;SEP&gt;A heritage conservation area is a designated area that contains heritage items and is protected to maintain its historical significance.</data>
