    <node id="State Environmental Planning Policy (Biodiversity and Conservation) 2021">
      <data key="d0">State Environmental Planning Policy (Biodiversity and Conservation) 2021</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The State Environmental Planning Policy (Biodiversity and Conservation) 2021 is a legislative framework established in New South Wales with the primary aim of protecting biodiversity values and preserving amenity, particularly in non-rural areas. This policy focuses on the conservation of biodiversity and the management of land use in relation to conservation efforts. It outlines specific requirements and guidelines designed to ensure the protection of biodiversity across the state, thereby promoting sustainable environmental practices and safeguarding natural habitats.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5ec2a6ccba69a9bd024daaab97a76cbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7320711159fac7b8b992e31aa693fc92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d9aab723725c29550d3d5992e38e1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b3e7253c92605b170ab298351d159ee</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756462544</data>
    </node>
    <node id="State Environmental Planning Policy (Housing) 2021">
      <data key="d0">State Environmental Planning Policy (Housing) 2021</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The State Environmental Planning Policy (Housing) 2021 focuses on enabling diverse housing types and ensuring new developments meet community needs and environmental standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The State Environmental Planning Policy (Housing) 2021 is a legislative framework that governs housing development and related planning provisions in New South Wales.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7320711159fac7b8b992e31aa693fc92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b3e7253c92605b170ab298351d159ee</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756462541</data>
    </node>
    <node id="State Environmental Planning Policy (Industry and Employment) 2021">
      <data key="d0">State Environmental Planning Policy (Industry and Employment) 2021</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The State Environmental Planning Policy (Industry and Employment) 2021 is a legislative framework established in New South Wales, Australia, designed to govern land use and development specifically for industrial and employment purposes. Its primary aim is to protect and enhance land designated for these uses, ensuring that zoning and environmental planning align with the objectives of promoting industrial growth and employment opportunities. The policy outlines specific land use zones and objectives that guide the development of industrial and employment-related projects, thereby facilitating sustainable economic development within the region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74ce6c48418e9656e9c481d5b9457651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c54e585ffe9dec258b3fafa2a969d4cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c071303ef64b88343c21eb269cb6d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b3e7253c92605b170ab298351d159ee</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1756462617</data>
    </node>
