    <edge source="Heritage Conservation Area" target="Leichhardt DCP 2013">
      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Heritage Conservation Area is a designated zone within the Leichhardt DCP 2013, which includes specific provisions aimed at protecting these areas. The DCP emphasizes the importance of maintaining the heritage significance of the Heritage Conservation Areas, ensuring that land uses within these zones enhance the neighborhood character. Furthermore, the Leichhardt DCP 2013 is committed to protecting and enhancing the Heritage Conservation Area through its regulations, incorporating guidelines designed to safeguard the integrity of these areas from adverse impacts. Overall, the DCP serves as a framework to preserve the historical and cultural value of the Heritage Conservation Area while promoting compatible development.</data>
      <data key="d8">development guideline,development guidelines,heritage conservation,heritage preservation,heritage protection,urban design,urban regulation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-af2f0d6ddbb1555c8a40b5236b475972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d18c8a03e8ddc5412376fe3469c2a28c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa4cb939266bae78512fd7c339d5c7e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-081fadc973ceb31c3d61aefc19c626f5</data>
